Date: Thu, 6 Aug 2026 16:20:06 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] feat(llama): add GGML fused SDPA op and integrate into
 graph

- ggml.h / ggml.c: new GGML_OP_FUSED_CPP_SDPA_EXT op + ggml_fused_cpp_sdpa_ext()
  (F32 q/k/v optional F16/F32 mask, MHA only)
- ops.h/ops.cpp: ggml_compute_forward_fused_cpp_sdpa_ext with head-level
  thread partitioning and 64x64 diagonal-block path for L==S
- ggml-cpu/CMakeLists.txt: ARM build wires fused-cpp sources under
  GGML_USE_FUSED_CPP_SDPA
- llama-graph.cpp/h: build_attn_mha picks the fused SDPA path on aarch64
  (env GGML_FUSED_CPP_SDPA can disable/debug)
